bacak-display-manager (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
    - Wayland-native display manager for the Bacak Desktop Environment.
    - Privilege-separated daemon / unprivileged greeter / session launcher.
    - PAM authentication, autologin, systemd + logind integration.
    - Touchscreen detection, virtual-keyboard and accessibility hooks.

 -- Bacak Desktop Project <packages@example.org>  Wed, 10 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000
